     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "The Date Picker Modal is useful in scenarios where date selection is a critical part of the process and the user needs a distraction-free environment to make a choice. It is commonly used in mobile designs where a full-screen modal provides more space for date selection, or when selecting dates is a primary task within a workflow, such as booking premises or setting up events. See Date Picker and Date Input for alternative solutions.",
